{"id":"L-meta-4366","title":"If every two-colour OR can be removed without growth step by step, then some edge circuit with no more gates and ANDs has none","formal_statement":"(∀ (p l : ℕ) (E : Finset (Fin p × Fin l)) (C : PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.Circuit),\n    (∀ (a a' : Fin p) (b b' : Fin l), a ≠ a' → b ≠ b' →\n        ¬ ((a, b) ∈ E ∧ (a, b') ∈ E ∧ (a', b) ∈ E ∧ (a', b') ∈ E)) →\n    PEqualNP.TopForm.IsAO2 (p + l) C →\n    (∀ x : Fin (p + l) → Bool, PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun (p + l) C x =\n        decide (∃ (a : Fin p) (b : Fin l), (a, b) ∈ E ∧ x (Fin.castAdd l a) = true ∧ x (Fin.natAdd p b) = true)) →\n    Set.ncard {j : ℕ | j < C.gates.length ∧ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).op = PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.or ∧\n        (∃ i ∈ PEqualNP.TopForm.orIn (p + l) C (p + l + j), (i : ℕ) < p) ∧\n        (∃ i ∈ PEqualNP.TopForm.orIn (p + l) C (p + l + j), p ≤ (i : ℕ))} ≠ 0 →\n    ∃ C' : PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.Circuit,\n      PEqualNP.TopForm.IsAO2 (p + l) C' ∧ C'.size ≤ C.size ∧\n      C'.gates.countP (fun g => PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.rec true false false (fun _ => false) false g.op) ≤\n        C.gates.countP (fun g => PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.rec true false false (fun _ => false) false g.op) ∧\n      PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun (p + l) C' = PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun (p + l) C ∧\n      (C'.size < C.size ∨\n       Set.ncard {j : ℕ | j < C'.gates.length ∧ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C' j).op = PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.or ∧\n          (∃ i ∈ PEqualNP.TopForm.orIn (p + l) C' (p + l + j), (i : ℕ) < p) ∧\n          (∃ i ∈ PEqualNP.TopForm.orIn (p + l) C' (p + l + j), p ≤ (i : ℕ))} <\n        Set.ncard {j : ℕ | j < C.gates.length ∧ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).op = PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.or ∧\n          (∃ i ∈ PEqualNP.TopForm.orIn (p + l) C (p + l + j), (i : ℕ) < p) ∧\n          (∃ i ∈ PEqualNP.TopForm.orIn (p + l) C (p + l + j), p ≤ (i : ℕ))})) →\n∀ (p l : ℕ) (E : Finset (Fin p × Fin l)) (C : PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.Circuit),\n  (∀ (a a' : Fin p) (b b' : Fin l), a ≠ a' → b ≠ b' →\n      ¬ ((a, b) ∈ E ∧ (a, b') ∈ E ∧ (a', b) ∈ E ∧ (a', b') ∈ E)) →\n  PEqualNP.TopForm.IsAO2 (p + l) C →\n  (∀ x : Fin (p + l) → Bool, PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun (p + l) C x =\n      decide (∃ (a : Fin p) (b : Fin l), (a, b) ∈ E ∧ x (Fin.castAdd l a) = true ∧ x (Fin.natAdd p b) = true)) →\n  ∃ C' : PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.Circuit,\n    PEqualNP.TopForm.IsAO2 (p + l) C' ∧\n    C'.size ≤ C.size ∧\n    C'.gates.countP (fun g => PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.rec true false false (fun _ => false) false g.op) ≤\n      C.gates.countP (fun g => PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.rec true false false (fun _ => false) false g.op) ∧\n    PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun (p + l) C' = PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun (p + l) C ∧\n    ∀ j < C'.gates.length,\n      (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C' j).op = PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.or →\n      ¬ ((∃ i ∈ PEqualNP.TopForm.orIn (p + l) C' (p + l + j), (i : ℕ) < p) ∧\n         (∃ i ∈ PEqualNP.TopForm.orIn (p + l) C' (p + l + j), p ≤ (i : ℕ)))","statement_hash":"sha256:3c96808c5bb17f13549dbd8179b8232d98b378375e8e0b68e01bfff5fb127c87","plain_statement":"Suppose: for every bipartite 4-cycle-free edge set and every AND/OR circuit (each gate reading exactly two earlier wires) computing its edge function with at least one OR gate reaching, through OR gates only, both a point input and a line input, some such circuit computes the same function with no more gates, no more AND gates, and either fewer gates or fewer such OR gates. Then for every such edge set and circuit there is a circuit computing the same function with no more gates and no more AND gates and with no such OR gate.","status":"checked","barrier":null,"depends_on":[],"program":"meta_complexity","seat":"seat-lib-1","proposed_at":"2026-11-24T18:48:21.446Z","attempts":[{"when":"2026-11-24T18:50:37.415Z","ended_at":"2026-11-24T18:50:37.415Z","by":"seat-lib-1","outcome":"checked","funded_by":{"kind":"baseline","name":"Brilliant"}}],"artifact":{"lean_file":"lean/PEqualNP/MetaComplexity/L4366.lean","checker_version":"check-lean 3, Lean 4.36.0, Mathlib fc4f59e577","checker_run_id":"run-043084","content_hash":"sha256:0f911dc092c0415a51638107526314a42af3f135a3f2738107f4676355c2c08b","rests_on":[{"module":"PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.L4366","sha256":"sha256:0f911dc092c0415a51638107526314a42af3f135a3f2738107f4676355c2c08b"}],"defs":[{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs","sha256":"sha256:e47d963e1079aa123b054463f4e127bd756974e19e22a34067484e45bc2773d9"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.AffinePlane","sha256":"sha256:cdbe8c67613572eba45565d50202ecb7ebecaf642b61b0e092e876d8888bf553"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.Algebraic","sha256":"sha256:3a63e982154f8681af693149da8dbef279f62a4943e0b955c11920d9318a0456"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.AndCountCircuit","sha256":"sha256:4e9aa467f041254025f1d29d39b5f21dcc4bf31adb64de2e7d3d7fd36bd02530"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.Base","sha256":"sha256:6b010a3577605e43ecd3f9121c1c2d0cfa82d8cfeb204c89a2c23154bc166e04"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.BicliqueBlockCost","sha256":"sha256:36f84880055a5ab87a000e9c1c5880a290444df8066e8fb9d9a8a0c3b4d065ce"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.BinaryCircuit","sha256":"sha256:a0a4f237ff5e7167ebb59fa94cfbfad38f5f8ded3fb3feab83847c174dfb443b"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.BlindGate","sha256":"sha256:7534d95a3bd426e6ab5f5dc9d29dd3b506066ec1f80789757958cd22a7aca6e1"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.BorrowedCoverCircuit","sha256":"sha256:5da8d25976b06d2a8bbaa4f1ab90ed5213b20ea2a4368fe9ce11c46f94a21a1a"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.CarriedProduct","sha256":"sha256:8cae3a5378c009b0c1f4baa661614641f4a12315199516fd82a2b8bc0736960d"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.CircuitLowerBounds","sha256":"sha256:695e454d3e424e2cae4fa4677741681eac11de0462d0d9bc087a0e6a6ba03f69"},{"module":"PEqualNP.Defs.CircuitMoves","sha256":"sha256:9862024b5fc02e2d15fb22ddb9d5a5f71fe9f604987fd13320ca0d34